Subject: [PATCH] T5.6: global parity and timing against MODFLOW 6

examples/global/parity_mf6.jl: record mGV's daily inputs to MODFLOW from the
year-200 checkpoint (coupled GPU run), replay them to the mf6 and GPU engines
from the same heads (open loop), timed per stage; parity_compare.jl: per-day
heads, baseflow and capillary rise against a reference run (T5.3 metric),
location of the largest differences, budgets, river-loss limit against its
formula. README section.
